{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：02:24 2026-11-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：02:24 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：02:24 2026-11-12 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28b58a7c9d559d52dcacfdbb476bf497/2026-11/RTC.jpeg\"/><p>跑馬地發生懷疑猝死事件。周三（11日）晚上10時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指發現其姓羅（47歲）女友在跑馬地禮頓道52號一單位內暈倒。</p><p>人員接報到場，女子昏迷被送往律敦治醫院治理，其後被證實死亡。死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，女事主有身體病紀錄。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:43:14.159159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T18:24:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T22:15:54.289891+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T18:36:23.178290+00:00","content_hash":"2790a8d1bd208e53c4595b9f6a8ab745937d4c09601b9c63208dee2b3ad711ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}